00:05:13.520 --> 00:05:14.577
This is my repo.

00:05:14.577 --> 00:05:15.785
I'm going to select a branch.

00:05:18.510 --> 00:05:23.070
And then select the
application in my repo

00:05:23.070 --> 00:05:26.840
that I want, give
it a title, App 1.

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:32.720
And when I hit deploy, again,
because I haven't specifically

00:05:32.720 --> 00:05:36.140
