00:08:18.550 --> 00:08:22.760
for targeting specific images,
but that is on our roadmap.

00:08:22.760 --> 00:08:27.320
So look out for that
if you're interested.

00:08:27.320 --> 00:08:28.580
All right.

00:08:28.580 --> 00:08:30.660
So now that I've
