00:10:50.740 --> 00:10:54.670
get nodes where they are.

00:10:54.670 --> 00:10:56.740
They're ready to go.

00:10:56.740 --> 00:10:59.290
And I've already set some
environment variables.

00:10:59.290 --> 00:11:02.230
I set up my RStudio
Connect license key

00:11:02.230 --> 00:11:05.470
